file (a file of 30k works), compression works well and browser  receives file correctly.\nBut when backend server send bigger file ( a file of 150k does not work), compression does not set Content-Length to the good zipped length and browser receives full file but wait for end of transfert...\n##### Working example:\n\nIn response to a http request, from backend, proxy receives 2 objects:\n**Object 1:**\nDefaultHttpResponse, decodeResult: success)\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\nCache-Control: max-age=3600\nContent-Length: 20923\nContent-Type: application/javascript\nETag: \"1365771653000-1710122363\"\nLast-Modified: Fri, 12 Apr 2013 13:00:53 GMT\nServer: Play! Framework;1.2.5;prod\n\n**Object 2:**\nDefaultLastHttpContent(data: UnpooledHeapByteBuf(ridx: 0, widx: 20923, cap: 20923), getDecoderResult: success)\n\nHttpObjectEncoder.encode() is called 3 times as parameter for _HttpObject msg _\n_call 1:_\nDefaultHttpResponse, decodeResult: success)\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\nCache-Control: max-age=3600\nContent-Type: application/javascript\nETag: \"1365771653000-1710122363\"\nLast-Modified: Fri, 12 Apr 2013 13:00:53 GMT\nServer: Play! Framework;1.2.5;prod\nContent-Encoding: **gzip**\nContent-Length: **6071** -> zipped length\n\n_call 2:_\nDefaultHttpContent(data: UnpooledHeapByteBuf(ridx: 0, widx: 6061, cap: 8192), getDecoderResult: success)\n\n_call 3:_\nDefaultLastHttpContent(data: UnpooledHeapByteBuf(ridx: 0, widx: 10, cap: 256), getDecoderResult: success)\n_note_: trailingHeaders is empty\n##### Not Working example:\n\nIn response to a http request, from backend, proxy receives **more than** 2 objetcs:\n\n_Object 1:_\nDefaultHttpResponse, decodeResult: success)\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\nCache-Control: max-age=3600\nContent-Length: **156183** -> please note length\nContent-Type: text/css; charset=utf-8\nETag: \"1365771653000--1319805301\"\nLast-Modified: Fri, 12 Apr 2013 13:00:53 GMT\nServer: Play! Framework;1.2.5;prod ***\n\n_Object 2:_\nDefaultHttpContent(data: UnpooledHeapByteBuf(ridx: 0, widx: 32768, cap: 32768), getDecoderResult: success) ***\n\n_Object 3:_\n**\\* DefaultHttpContent(data: UnpooledHeapByteBuf(ridx: 0, widx: 32768, cap: 32768), getDecoderResult: success) ***\n\n_Object X:_\n.....\n\n_Object last:_\n**\\* DefaultLastHttpContent(data: UnpooledHeapByteBuf(ridx: 0, widx: 2399, cap: 2399), getDecoderResult: success) ***\n\nHttpObjectEncoder.encode() is called N times as parameter for _HttpObject msg _\n_call 1_\nDefaultHttpResponse, decodeResult: success)\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\nCache-Control: max-age=3600\nContent-Length: **156183** -> wrong\nContent-Type: text/css; charset=utf-8\nETag: \"1365771653000--1319805301\"\nLast-Modified: Fri, 12 Apr 2013 13:00:53 GMT\nServer: Play! Framework;1.2.5;prod\nContent-Encoding: **gzip**\n\n_call 2_\nDefaultHttpContent(data: UnpooledHeapByteBuf(ridx: 0, widx: 6209, cap: 8192), getDecoderResult: success)\n\n_call X:_\n....\n\n_call last:_\nDefaultLastHttpContent(data: UnpooledHeapByteBuf(ridx: 0, widx: 10, cap: 256), getDecoderResult: success)\n_note_: trailingHeaders is empty\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/1275/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/1275/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/16480284","html_url":"https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/1280#issuecomment-16480284","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/1280","id":16480284,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE2NDgwMjg0","user":{"login":"trustin","id":173918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzkxOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trustin","html_url":"https://github.com/trustin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trustin/followers","following_url":"http